---
import SubPageLayout from '../layouts/SubPageLayout.astro';
---
<SubPageLayout title="Colophon" description="How Will Perry Evans built this site.">
  <article class="colophon">
    <h1>How I built this site</h1>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        I built this site myself with Claude Code, an AI coding assistant. I wrote the content and
        made the design decisions, and I used AI to write and test the code. I reviewed every change
        before it went live. The site is built with Astro and hosted on GitHub Pages. I believe
        technology should empower people, and I aspire to use it in a responsible and transparent
        way.
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>
</SubPageLayout>

<style>
  .colophon h1 {
    font-size: var(--text-2xl);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-5);
  }
</style>
